  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5102.87 Tarnic Pond",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5102.87 Tarnic Pond. No person shall operate a motorboat at a rate of speed exceeding 10 miles per hour upon the waters of Tarnic Pond, also known as Otternick Lake, in the town of Hudson.\n\nSource. #8172, eff 9-21-04 (from Saf-C 402.71); ss by #10169, EXEMPT, eff 8-8-12 (formerly Saf-C 402.80) (See Revision Note #2 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5100)",
